data-hpc=\"true\" containertiming=\"hpc\"><article itemprop=\"text\"><P dir=\"auto\"><h2 dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"-1\">FF-16-TUI (Find Frequent 16-bit Text User Interface)</h2><a id=\"user-content-ff-16-tui-find-frequent-16-bit-text-user-interface\" aria-label=\"Permalink: FF-16-TUI (Find Frequent 16-bit Text User Interface)\" href=\"#ff-16-tui-find-frequent-16-bit-text-user-interface\"></a></P>\n<P dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" dir=\"auto\">What does FF-16-TUI do?</h2><a id=\"user-content-what-does-ff-16-tui-do\" aria-label=\"Permalink: What does FF-16-TUI do?\" href=\"#what-does-ff-16-tui-do\"></a></P>\n<p dir=\"auto\">FF-16-TUI is an interactive static analysis tool that finds frequently occurring local 16-bit patterns across the entire file. It can help to locate structures from frequent patterns and understand file layout.</p>\n<P dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" dir=\"auto\">Text User Interface</h2><a id=\"user-content-text-user-interface\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Text User Interface\" href=\"#text-user-interface\"></a></P>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/119726548/641490312-8da1c4a1-9b66-46ac-88cb-b69bbe3f9df3.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODgwMTQxOTIsIm5iZiI6MTc4ODAxMzg5MiwicGF0aCI6Ii8xMTk3MjY1NDgvNjQxNDkwMzEyLThkYTFjNGExLTliNjYtNDZhYy04OGNiLWI2OWJiZTNmOWRmMy5wbmc_._J7AOLMyXrSxts8ISBE5oO2iLCpigCUDczG9nkjiaWg\"><img width=\"937\" height=\"746\" alt=\"ff-16-tui\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/119726548/641490312-8da1c4a1-9b66-46ac-88cb-b69bbe3f9df3.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODgwMTQxOTIsIm5iZiI6MTc4ODAxMzg5MiwicGF0aCI6Ii8xMTk3MjY1NDgvNjQxNDkwMzEyLThkYTFjNGExLTliNjYtNDZhYy04OGNiLWI2OWJiZTNmOWRmMy5wbmc_._J7AOLMyXrSxts8ISBE5oO2iLCpigCUDczG9nkjiaWg\"></a>\n<P dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" dir=\"auto\">Command line usage</h2><a id=\"user-content-command-line-usage\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Command line usage\" href=\"#command-line-usage\"></a></P>\n<div data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"ff-16-tui [filename] [-d <filename>]\n\n  <filename>      Target file\n  -d <filename>   Dictionary file  (Default: dict.csv)\"><pre><code>ff-16-tui [filename] [-d &lt;filename&gt;]\n\n  &lt;filename&gt;      Target file\n  -d &lt;filename&gt;   Dictionary file  (Default: dict.csv)\n</code></pre></div>\n<P dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" dir=\"auto\">Keyboard shortcuts</h2><a id=\"user-content-keyboard-shortcuts\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Keyboard shortcuts\" href=\"#keyboard-shortcuts\"></a></P>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Hexdump panel:</p>\n<markdown-accessiblity-table><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Key</th>\n<th>Function</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>←</td>\n<td>Previous byte</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>→</td>\n<td>Next byte</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>↑</td>\n<td>Previous line</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>↓</td>\n<td>Next line</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PgUp</td>\n<td>Previous page</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PgDn</td>\n<td>Next page</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Home</td>\n<td>Beginning of file</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>End</td>\n<td>End of file</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Pattern panel:</p>\n<markdown-accessiblity-table><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Key</th>\n<th>Function</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>Highlight pattern (most frequent)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>Highlight pattern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>Highlight pattern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>Highlight pattern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>Highlight pattern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>Highlight pattern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>Highlight pattern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>Highlight pattern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>Highlight pattern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>Highlight pattern (least frequent)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Filter panel:</p>\n<markdown-accessiblity-table><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Key</th>\n<th>Function</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>q</td>\n<td>Increase the minimum gap</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>s</td>\n<td>Decrease the minimum gap</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>w</td>\n<td>Increase the maximum gap</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>s</td>\n<td>Decrease the maximum gap</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>e</td>\n<td>Increase the minimum set bits</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>d</td>\n<td>Decrease the minimum set bits</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>r</td>\n<td>Increase the maximum set bits</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>f</td>\n<td>Decrease the maximum set bits</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>t</td>\n<td>Increase the threshold</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>g</td>\n<td>Decrease the threashold</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>\n<P dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" dir=\"auto\">Terminologies</h2><a id=\"user-content-terminologies\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Terminologies\" href=\"#terminologies\"></a></P>\n<markdown-accessiblity-table><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Term</th>\n<th>Description</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Ones</td>\n<td>The number of bits set in the pattern.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Freq</td>\n<td>The frequency of the pattern.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Dict</td>\n<td>The dictionary entry for the pattern.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>\n</article></div></div></div></DIV>","content_text":"Folders and filesNameNameLast commit messageLast commit dateLICENSELICENSEREADME.mdREADME.mddict.csvdict.csvff-16-tui.goff-16-tui.gogo.modgo.modgo.sumgo.sumREADMEMIT licenseFF-16-TUI (Find Frequent 16-bit Text User Interface) What does FF-16-TUI do? FF-16-TUI is an interactive static analysis tool that finds frequently occurring local 16-bit patterns across the entire file. It can help to locate structures from frequent patterns and understand fi